{"2246550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Interkosmos 2000", "steam_appid": 2246550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Interkosmos 2000 is perfect for...</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/7633dff03deaf75ebc16859b320c6d3b.avif?t=1780168860\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras_big/7633dff03deaf75ebc16859b320c6d3b.avif?t=1780168860 width=1560 height=1286 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/5506860720fccf5211f651a069229f8a.poster.avif?t=1780168860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/5506860720fccf5211f651a069229f8a.webm?t=1780168860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/5506860720fccf5211f651a069229f8a.mp4?t=1780168860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WELCOME (BACK) TO SPACE. It's the year 2000, and the future is hanging by a thread.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the claustrophobic capsules of the 70s. This time, you're at the helm of an advanced space shuttle, but technology loves to play tricks - especially with the infamous Y2K bug looming. <i>Interkosmos 2000</i> is an even wilder, weirder, and more unpredictable VR adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't just have to maintain orbit (and remember to breathe); you must actively pilot the ship and keep it from falling apart. If you fail? Well, you better start spelling D-O-O-M.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/e1bddae600de3590893a912d411bbac9.poster.avif?t=1780168860\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/e1bddae600de3590893a912d411bbac9.webm?t=1780168860\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2246550/extras/e1bddae600de3590893a912d411bbac9.mp4?t=1780168860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Total System Control:</strong> Maintain constant situational awareness. Manage your engine levels and monitor all critical systems to ensure your survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-Stakes Maintenance:</strong> You are in charge. When things break down, it's up to you to make fast decisions and prioritize repairs to keep the capsule running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Navigation:</strong> Steer through tricky asteroid fields, execute delicate docking maneuvers at space stations, and guide your ship safely back to Earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Audiovisuals:</strong> Experience the awe and isolation of space, enhanced by striking graphics and atmospheric sound design that pull you deep into the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Story Campaign:</strong> Embark on a wild, fascinating space ride full of unexpected events, from launch to landing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrestrained Sandbox Mode:</strong> Take a break from the pressure. Float freely, practice your skills, and enjoy the cosmos at your own pace. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla